 render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."},"255":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-47","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#layout-and-sizing","content":"Set `size` on `ChipGroup` to keep a collection consistent. `ChipList` wraps by\ndefault and accepts layout props for custom arrangements. See **Sizes**."},"256":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-48","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#button-composition","content":"Use `ChipButton` when Chip presentation is needed without collection semantics.\nCompose it with components such as `MenuTrigger`; those components continue to\nown open state, focus, and keyboard behavior. See **Menu filter trigger**."},"257":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-49","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use `Label` or `aria-label` to name the `ChipGroup`; this names the collection,\nnot its individual Chips."},"258":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-50","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Give each Chip a visible label, `textValue`, or `aria-label`. Use `textValue`\nwhen a Chip contains icons, composed content, or a render prop."},"259":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-51","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use a descriptive group label so removal actions can be announced clearly."},"260":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-52","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Keep the visible label and the accessible value synchronized."},"261":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-53","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."},"262":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-54","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Keep labels concise and let them truncate only when the available width requires it."},"263":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-55","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Prefer groups of three or more related values."},"264":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-56","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Keep one size per group."},"265":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-57","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Let `ChipList` wrap instead of forcing a single horizontal line."},"266":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-58","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Use removable Chips for user-added filters and tokens."},"267":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-59","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"For menu filters, use `ChipButton` with `MenuTrigger` and provide the chevron explicitly."},"268":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-60","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#a-chipgroup-has-no-accessible-name","content":"Add a visible `Label` to the group or provide `aria-label`. For an individual Chip\nwith composed content, provide a visible label, `textValue`, or `aria-label`."},"269":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-61","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#the-remove-action-does-not-update-the-ui","content":"Add `onRemove` to `ChipGroup` and remove the returned keys from the collection\nowned by your application."},"270":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-62","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#a-composed-label-is-not-truncating-correctly","content":"Keep the label in `Text`, preserve `textValue`, and constrain the available width\nof the surrounding layout. Truncation is visual; the complete accessible value\nshould remain available."},"271":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-63","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#the-menu-trigger-does-not-look-like-a-chip","content":"Use `ChipButton` inside `MenuTrigger`, include the visible value, and add a\ntrailing chevron to communicate that the control opens a menu."},"272":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-64","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#props","content":"For a menu trigger, the button and menu are composed as siblings inside\n`MenuTrigger`:"},"273":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"page","content":"DatePicker","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker"},"274":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-0","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker","content":"Date fields that display the selected value as a label and open a calendar popover to pick a single date (DatePicker) or a range (DateRangePicker)."},"275":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-1","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#features","content":"Features"},"276":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-2","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/date-picker#installation","content":"Installation"},"277":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-3","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker"