heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#props","content":"Props"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-12","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip","content":"Tooltips appear after a short delay when hovering, and immediately when the element receives focus.\nOnce a tooltip has been shown, subsequent tooltips appear without delay."},"1567":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-13","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip","content":"`TooltipTrigger` wraps a focusable element and a `<Tooltip>`, handling hover/focus state and positioning automatically."},"1568":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-14","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"`overlay` elevation panel positioned relative to its trigger, with an optional arrow"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-15","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"Flips and shifts to stay in the viewport"},"1570":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-16","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#features","content":"Configurable open and close delays"},"1571":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-17","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#default","content":"Use it with `TooltipTrigger`, which wraps both the tooltip content and a focusable element such as a `Button`. The tooltip appears on hover and focus."},"1572":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-18","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#custom-anchor","content":"To position a tooltip relative to a different focusable element, use the `triggerRef` prop. `TooltipTrigger` still handles showing and hiding on hover and focus."},"1573":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-19","page_id":"/d