nce Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1615,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1647,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1548,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1620,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1645,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1642,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1145,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1146,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1281,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[460,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1676,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1613,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1177,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[697,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[1525,"**Space / Enter**"],[1025,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[459,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[745,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1149,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[584,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[594,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1288,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[845,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon, `variant=\"control\"`, and `size` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1650,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1639,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[534,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[578,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1521,"**Tab**"],[458,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1022,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1147,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1463,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1461,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1462,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[977,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1517,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1516,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1654,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1643,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[593,"**Trade-offs:**"],[535,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[290,"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value from the field. `DatePickerCalendar` (and `DateRangePickerCalendar`) is the calendar in the popover it opens: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[1175,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[748,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[1906,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[528,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1622,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1855,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[596,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[597,"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[607,"**Use sprite mode**: For repeated icons, consider sprite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[848,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1179,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1421,"**